ci: run on the standard runner only

What:
Drop the runner matrix and always use the standard 2-vCPU runner. Also emit the
timings as a workflow notice, not only as an artifact.

Why:
Larger runners are not enabled on this account, so the second matrix leg queued
indefinitely and never produced a result. Any comparison target with more CPU is
therefore being flattered rather than handicapped, which should be stated
alongside any number this workflow produces.
